 "y": 140, "text": "Confidence is text\nthe model wrote.\nDecoding enforces\nthe schema.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "02-output-contract-10", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#4b7864", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260936, "x": 400, "y": 300, "width": 230, "height": 80, "backgroundColor": "#4b7864", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "label": {"text": "Decision model", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "strokeColor": "#ffffff"}}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "02-output-contract-11", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#292c2b", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260937, "x": 640, "y": 340, "width": 90, "height": 0, "points": [[0, 0], [90, 0]], "endArrowhead": "arrow", "strokeStyle": "solid"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "02-output-contract-12", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#4b7864", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260938, "x": 740, "y": 300, "width": 250, "height": 80, "backgroundColor": "#4b7864", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "label": {"text": "Distribution", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "strokeColor": "#ffffff"}}, {"type": "text", "id": "02-output-contract-13", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#292c2b", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260939, "x": 742, "y": 395, "text": "travel        0.81\nout_of_scope  0.12\nutility       0.07", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 3}, {"type": "text", "id": "02-output-contract-14", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#666b68", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260940, "x": 410, "y": 400, "text": "Probabilities over\nthe options you sent.\nNo text is generated.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1}, {"type": "text", "id": "02-output-contract-15", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#666b68", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260941, "x": 40, "y": 500, "text": "Both return something code can branch on. Only one of them was trained to make the number mean something.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1}]}, {"name": "03-family", "elements": [{"type": "text", "id": "03-family-1", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#292c2b", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260927, "x": 30, "y": 10, "text": "One interface, several ways to build it.", "fontSize": 25, "fontFamily": 1}, {"type": "text", "id": "03-family-2", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#666b68", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260928, "x": 40, "y": 70, "text": "Everything below takes a state plus typed options and returns probabilities.", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "03-family-3", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#4b7864", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260929, "x": 40, "y": 120, "width": 290, "height": 80, "backgroundColor": "#4b7864", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "label": {"text": "Trained for decisions", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 2, "strokeColor": "#ffffff"}}, {"type": "text", "id": "03-family-4", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#292c2b", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260930, "x": 48, "y": 215, "text": "Jev (TypeSafe)\nhosted, RLCD, jev-1.13\n\nLaya (ConvAI)\nopen encoders,\n322M to 421M params", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "03-family-5", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#80658f", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260931, "x": 360, "y": 120, "width": 290, "height": 80, "backgroundColor": "#80658f", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "label": {"text": "Repurposed generator", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 2, "strokeColor": "#ffffff"}}, {"type": "text", "id": "03-family-6", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#292c2b", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260932, "x": 368, "y": 215, "text": "DiffusionGemma-as-Jev\nvLLM patch,\none denoising step\n\nAny LLM with logprobs\nread the option tokens", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "03-family-7", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#a38b6e", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260933, "x": 680, "y": 120, "width": 290, "height": 80, "backgroundColor": "#a38b6e", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "label": {"text": "Fine-tuned small LM", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 2, "strokeColor": "#ffffff"}}, {"type": "text", "id": "03-family-8", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#292c2b", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260934, "x": 688, "y": 215, "text": "Tev1-4B (Together)\nQwen3.5 4B,\nabout $17 to train\n\nYour own classifier\nfixed labels, needs data", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "03-family-9", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#666b68", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260935, "x": 25, "y": 108, "width": 960, "height": 320, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"type": "text", "id": "03-family-10", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#292c2b", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260936, "x": 40, "y": 460, "text": "\u201cSystem One\u201d names a contract. Only some of these were trained for it.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1}]}, {"name": "04-diffusion-canvas", "elements": [{"type": "text", "id": "04-diffusion-canvas-1", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#292c2b", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260927, "x": 30, "y": 10, "text": "DiffusionGemma as a decision model.", "fontSize": 25, "fontFamily": 1}, {"type": "text", "id": "04-diffusion-canvas-2", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#666b68", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260928, "x": 40, "y": 70, "text": "Pin every token you already know. Leave one slot open. Denoise once. Read the slot.", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "04-diffusion-canvas-3", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#557f91", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260929, "x": 40, "y": 130, "width": 100, "height": 70, "backgroundColor": "#557f91", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "label": {"text": "Q: route", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "strokeColor": "#ffffff"}}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "04-diffusion-canvas-4", "roughness": 0.5, "strokeColor": "#557f91", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "seed": 20260930, "x": 150, "y": 130, "width": 100, "height": 70, "backgroundColor": "#557f91", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "